        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "I bought my extensions here after a terrible experience elsewhere, and I don't regret my choice at all!! Besides having white-blonde tape-in ​​extensions in stock (rare!), the hair texture and color are incredible. I was really surprised by the price for this quality!!! The service was friendly and professional, and the delivery was fast! In short, I found a gem ^_^",
