        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "I have just finished my training in classic eyelash application, wow great academy, great staff. Super well received, I immediately felt at ease. Amelie is a caring woman and takes her time with us!",
        "time": 1607374893,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "jenni tess",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107825998990465161659/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
