        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLxY55dJkjpnFoacAdTvIdq9CcZM5300qWIheyI2MIf-Pt8aQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "I had the pleasure of receiving incredible service at the salon last week. I tried several places before finding this one. Now all my treatments will be done here :) I love the quality of the extensions and the products used. Everything is top-notch: the staff, the products, the professionalism. They really know how to advise and gave me the best results I could have imagined! It's clear that their staff is very well-trained and attentive. I recommend the salon a million times over for all your beauty treatments! I can't wait to go back next week for my lashes :) Thank you, ladies, you are amazing and your knowledge is unparalleled in the industry!",
        "time": 1519870597,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "lyneg12",
